      "content": "it's just... it's hard for me to write when i feel like that too. like, when i'm typing his words, it feels less like i'm making something up and more like i'm just describing how i feel right now. if there's no way to change things and the only way to \"rest\" is to just stop fighting... does that mean the story has to end there? for him, i mean. if he can't find a way to live with the weight, is the only real resolution just... letting go?",
